sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 企业微信用户
    participant WX as 企业微信平台
    participant Adapter as WeCom Adapter
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant BUS as RedisBus
    participant WRK as Worker
    participant Router as storage.Router
    participant Runner as runner.Runner
    participant LLM as Model Endpoint
    participant Tool as Tool
    participant Session as Session DB
    participant Memory as Memory DB
    participant Audit as Audit DB
    participant Outbox as Outbox DB

    User->>WX: 发送消息
    WX->>Adapter: WSS 回调
    Adapter->>GW: InboundMessage

    Note over GW: trace_id 生成<br/>幂等校验<br/>路由解析
    GW->>BUS: PublishInbound
    BUS->>WRK: XReadGroup

    Note over WRK: 幂等校验<br/>租户策略<br/>LockSession

    WRK->>Router: Sessions(tenantID)
    Router-->>WRK: session.Service

    WRK->>Runner: runner.Run

    Runner->>LLM: model.Call
    LLM-->>Runner: tool_calls
    Runner->>Tool: tool.Execute
    Tool-->>Runner: tool result
    Runner->>LLM: model.Call
    LLM-->>Runner: final text

    Runner-->>WRK: events 完成

    WRK->>Session: SaveSession
    WRK->>Memory: AddMemory
    WRK->>Audit: Record Entry
    WRK->>Outbox: Append

    Outbox->>BUS: stream:outbound
    BUS->>GW: ReadOutbound
    GW->>Adapter: OutboundMessage
    Adapter->>WX: Send
    WX->>User: 收到回复
